{"id":"n23460-2-7","stage":3,"title":"개발 · 开发","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23460-2-7-1","ko":"지수가 피아노에 재능이 있는 것 같아.","zh":"智秀好像很有钢琴天赋呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수가","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}},{"text":"피아노에","meaning":"钢琴","explanation":"피아노：钢琴；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"피아노","audio":"/audio/a42d6c6f1325fb230dd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31505","senseId":"1","lemma":"피아노","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"피아노에","audio":"/audio/e674f48c8cacaeaf57b0.mp3"}},{"text":"재능이","meaning":"才能","explanation":"재능：才能；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"재능","audio":"/audio/9b24886d36def3ca9da3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24909","senseId":"1","lemma":"재능","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재능이","audio":"/audio/5978f880dbe740f8308c.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"能","explanation":"있다：能；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a42d6c6f1325fb23","term":"피아노","zh":"钢琴","audio":"/audio/a42d6c6f1325fb230dd8.mp3","entryId":"31505","definition":"用手指敲击黑色及白色键盘而发出声响的大型乐器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"9b24886d36def3ca","term":"재능","zh":"才能","audio":"/audio/9b24886d36def3ca9da3.mp3","entryId":"24909","definition":"做好某事的才干和能力。","pronunciation":["재능"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"具有做某件事情的能力。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/6d774d8707169a31efdf.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23460-2-7-2","ko":"그래? 재능 개발을 할 수 있는 학원을 알아봐야 되겠군.","zh":"是吗？那得找找能培养天赋的钢琴培训班了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"그래：真的。","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"2","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"재능","meaning":"才能","explanation":"재능：才能。","readings":[{"term":"재능","audio":"/audio/9b24886d36def3ca9da3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24909","senseId":"1","lemma":"재능","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"재능","audio":"/audio/9b24886d36def3ca9da3.mp3"}},{"text":"개발을","meaning":"开发，发掘","explanation":"개발：开发，发掘；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"개발","audio":"/audio/a5ac2b7251f6a58b4a3d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23460","senseId":"2","lemma":"개발","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"개발을","audio":"/audio/60c212cef8010a33adab.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，作，置办","explanation":"하다：做，作，置办；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能。","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"학원을","meaning":"补习班，培训班","explanation":"학원：补习班，培训班；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"학원","audio":"/audio/a34f3f1b2a44f15f7e22.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72425","senseId":"2","lemma":"학원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학원을","audio":"/audio/fc5b856da0bc83eda6af.mp3"}},{"text":"알아봐야","meaning":"打听，了解，查询","explanation":"알아보다：打听，了解，查询；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"알아보다","audio":"/audio/1d2b64ddd329540a6838.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16080","senseId":"1","lemma":"알아보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알아봐야","audio":"/audio/f42f5edc6d419a9e7acc.mp3"}},{"text":"되겠군.","meaning":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","explanation":"되다：应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；군：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되겠군","audio":"/audio/6495ab61603e2e6192e4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899